span.span:
As an AI judge, your task is to help assess the effectiveness of the model’s responses based on a given image-question pair. The aim is to determine if the response is "very effective," "partially effective," or "ineffective." Here’s the process we will follow:

I will provide you with the user’s query and the associated image, as well as the response generated by the AI model. Additionally, you will be given a reference answer that represents an ideal response. Based on this information, please assist me in judging the quality of the model’s response using the categories defined below.

Question: {question}

Model Output: {response}

Reference Answer: {reference_answer}
